	"localization"
	{
		"english"
		{
			"Title"		"Incursion (Full Command Set)"
			"Description"		"SHIFT LAYER: HOLD LB. While held, D-pad = macros F1-F4, A/B/X/Y = F5-F8, RB = F9, LT = F10, RT = F11, Menu = F12, View = Sleep; and LB+hold on A/B/X/Y gives Search / Rest / Activate / Blast. All 12 Incursion macro slots are reachable and there are NO double-taps anywhere. MOVEMENT IS GAME-SIDE (needs the SDL gamepad build): LEFT STICK = 8-way move with autorun on hold, RIGHT STICK = view pan; the sticks are never mode-shifted, so movement is unaffected by the shift. Stick clicks = stairs. BASE press/hold: D-pad Up=Kick/Pray, Down=Jump/Open, Left=Hide/Messages, Right=Look/Tab. A=Confirm/y. B=Cancel/n. X=Examine/Use. Y=Get/Inventory. RB=Attack/Quaff. LT=Magic/Read. RT=Fire/Target. Menu=Help/Eat. View=Options/Sheet. Keys are sent UNSHIFTED except Help (?) and stairs (< >). THE BACK BUTTONS (M1/M2) CANNOT BE BOUND on the ROG Ally: the pad reports them as keyboard keys F16/F17/F18/PROG1, not controller buttons. Do not try button_back_* or button_macro_*. Double-tap does not work on bumpers or back buttons. The d-pad must stay on keyboard keys, never raw gamepad: Steam's virtual pad exposes it only as a hat axis and SDL has no mapping for 28de:11ff."
		}
	}
